answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.（12分）\n(1)"},{"type":"math","value":"a = \\frac{B_1IL}{m} = \\frac{B_1EL}{mr}"},{"type":"text","value":"（2分）\n(2) ①MN 左侧范围足够大, 故最终会匀速, 速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"有"},{"type":"math","value":"k_{1}v_{m} = B_{1}I_{1}L"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）且"},{"type":"math","value":"I_{1} = \\frac{E - B_{1}Lv_{m}}{r}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）综合可得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{m} = \\frac{B_{1}EL}{k_{1}r + B_{1}^{2}L^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n②棒在加速过程中"},{"type":"math","value":"B_{1}Lq - \\Sigma k_{1}v\\Delta t = mv_{m} - 0"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）又"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Sigma k_1v\\Delta t = k_1x_0"},{"type":"text","value":"综上可得"},{"type":"math","value":"q = \\frac{k_1x_0 + mv_m}{B_1L}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(3) ① 在 MN 右侧:"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{\\text {安}} = B_{2}I_{0}L = k_{2}I_{0}Lx"},{"type":"text","value":"令"},{"type":"math","value":"k = k_2I_0L"},{"type":"text","value":"则"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{\\text {回}} = -kx"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）即导体棒在 MN 右侧做简谐运动，平衡位置在 MN 处由"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2} k x_m^2 = \\frac{1}{2} mv_m^2"},{"type":"text","value":"综上可得"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{m} = v_{m}\\sqrt{\\frac{m}{k_{2}I_{0}L}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（2 分）\n②棒在 MN 右侧运动时间"},{"type":"math","value":"t = \\frac{T}{2} = \\pi \\sqrt{\\frac{m}{k}} = \\pi \\sqrt{\\frac{m}{k_2I_0L}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（2 分）（备注：若求出周期 T 或四分之一周期，具体表达式正确的，给 1 分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-27-shoukao--xinzhendi-lianmeng-2610-q18","paper_id":"zj-27-shoukao--xinzhendi-lianmeng-2610","source_question_id":"xinzhendi-lianmeng-2610-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"2ab4ffa1de24ab0fe923cdac633cc7a713d92cf19477d4b5c184d84d9b45fdb3","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. 在离子阱量子计算与离子光钟中，难以直接激光冷却的“逻辑离子”要靠“协同冷却”：让一个冷却离子与它结成离子对，通过库仑作用把热量带走。这一技术的理想极限是：冷却离子与逻辑离子发生一次碰撞，恰好把逻辑离子的动能全部带走，使其静止在阱中心——“单发冷却”。现在将模型简化如下：\n真空区域内只有范围足够大的匀强磁场，磁感应强度大小为 B，方向垂直纸面向外。取 O 为原点、PO 方向为 x 轴建立如图坐标系。逻辑离子 A（质量 m，电荷量 +q）从 P 点垂直于 PO 方向射入磁场，经半圆弧到达 O 点，PO 间距为 2R；冷却离子 C（质量 km，k 为已知常数且 0 < k < 1，电荷量 +q）与 A 同时出发，两离子首次到 O 点即在 O 点发生对心弹性正碰；碰撞后 A 恰好静止在 O 点（单发冷却），C 携带能量离开；\n已知 "},{"type":"math","value":"q"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"k"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"R"},{"type":"text","value":" ，两离子除在 "},{"type":"math","value":"O"},{"type":"text","value":" 点附近极短时间内的相互作用外，其余飞行时间内的库仑相互作用忽略不计，不计重力。求\n（1）求离子 A 的入射速度大小 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 和它从 P 运动到 O 所用的时间 t。\n（2）碰后A静止于 "},{"type":"math","value":"O"},{"type":"text","value":" 点，C带走全部动能，为了防止C又回到 "},{"type":"math","value":"O"},{"type":"text","value":" 点，可在 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴上放置一个回收装置（可视为质点），问此装置在 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴上的坐标 "},{"type":"math","value":"x_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（3）在真实的“协同冷却”技术中，常用一价 "},{"type":"math","value":"^{40}Ca^{+}"},{"type":"text","value":" 作为逻辑离子A，一价 "},{"type":"math","value":"^{24}Mg^{+}"},{"type":"text","value":" 作为冷却离子C协同冷却，求离子C在第一象限出发点的位置坐标 "},{"type":"math","value":"(x, y)"},{"type":"text","value":" ，以及其初速度方向与x轴正方向的夹角 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（4）有人认为该模型中离子间的库仑力较大，不能忽略，请通过求离子受到的电场力和磁场力的比值，说说你的见解。（取两离子飞行途中的典型间距 "},{"type":"math","value":"r=1\\times10^{-3}"},{"type":"text","value":" m，速率取 "},{"type":"math","value":"10^{5}"},{"type":"text","value":" m/s、B=0.50 T，静电力常量 "},{"type":"math","value":"k_{0}=9.0\\times10^{9}"},{"type":"text","value":" N·m²/C²， "},{"type":"math","value":"q=1.6\\times10^{-19}"},{"type":"text","value":" C。）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/1a78384117b61a9a8c392ca92cc29abb754c1a5ccf6422f2c697cc2cb4868c2d.png","width":422,"height":373,"width_mm":49.502,"row_group":"xinzhendi-lianm