 O 点用时："},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}=\\frac{T_{1}}{2}=\\frac{5}{6}T_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则对 C 离子做圆周运动轨迹对应圆心角"},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":"有"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{\\theta}{2\\pi}=\\frac{5}{6}"},{"type":"text","value":"可得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta=\\frac{5\\pi}{3}rad=300^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":"，\n由几何知识易知其初速度方向与水平夹角"},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha=30^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n出发时的坐标"},{"type":"math","value":"x=\\frac{r_{2}}{2}=\\frac{R}{10}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分），"},{"type":"math","value":"y=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}r_{2}=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{10}R"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n（4）计算库仑力"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{\\text{库}} = \\frac{k_0q^2}{r^2} \\approx 2.3 \\times 10^{-22} N"},{"type":"text","value":"，洛伦兹力"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{\\text{洛}} = qvB \\approx 8 \\times 10^{-15} N"},{"type":"text","value":"由"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{F_{\\text{库}}}{F_{\\text{洛}}} = 3 \\times 10^{-8}"},{"type":"text","value":"知库仑力是洛伦兹力得亿分之一量级，可以忽略不计。（2分）"}]}}]}
